## ISO installer extras (Kicksecure): ONLY packages the ISO/installer/live path
## needs that are NOT already installed by the flavor metapackage graph
## (dist-general-cli / dist-nonqubes-cli, pulled by every kicksecure host flavor)
## or by build-steps.d/3500_install-packages (its availability-checked
## efi_weak_recommended list + its explicit pkg-install / pkg-add calls).
## Duplicating those here only risks drift -- and a hard-listed EFI package would
## break a build on an arch that lacks it, which 3500's checked list avoids.

